{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV飲食節目《港出好味道》最後一集，COLLAR成員蘇雅琳（Ivy）與沈貞巧（Gao）化身英國酒吧一日店 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV飲食節目《港出好味道》最後一集，COLLAR成員蘇雅琳（Ivy）與沈貞巧（Gao）化身英國酒吧一日店長挑戰調酒任務。原本充滿粉紅泡泡的浪漫搭訕情節，卻因為一句稱呼瞬間變成爆笑炒車現場。這場充滿戲劇性反轉的互動意外掀起全網熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>Ivy調酒一舉動 Kit急救駕全場爆笑</strong></b></h2>\n<p>在上演浪漫搭訕之前，其實還發生了一段超搞笑的「蝦碌」插曲！Ivy在酒吧親自調製雞尾酒，有模有樣地搖勻後準備倒酒，但竟然「倒極都倒唔出」？在旁的Kit見狀急忙上前救駕，一秒篤穿真相，原來Ivy心急得連酒蓋都未開！發現自己擺烏龍的Ivy頓時瘀到尷尬傻笑，可愛的舉動惹得全場工作人員爆笑連連。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>Ivy上演浪漫搭訕戲碼</strong></b></h2>\n<p>在節目拍攝期間蘇雅琳與沈貞巧親自落場體驗英國小店運作，更穿起圍裙走到吧枱後學習調製專屬雞尾酒。當蘇雅琳拿起搖酒壺準備大顯身手時突然戲癮大發主動出擊，以極其嬌媚語氣向站在身旁沈貞巧大拋媚眼，並甜笑著說出：「靚女，請你飲杯酒啊！」這句經典台詞。現場氣氛瞬間升溫，這杯粉紅色特飲配上玫瑰花點綴令場面充滿粉紅氣息。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>沈貞巧冷酷反擊一句話瞬間破壞氣氛</strong></b></h2>\n<p>面對突如其來的猛烈攻勢，沈貞巧完全不解溫柔，不但沒有配合「劇情」，反而毫不留情地對著Ivy大叫一聲：「姐姐！」這個極具破壞力的回應瞬間將原本的浪漫氛圍擊得粉碎，令Ivy當場爆笑天然呆。兩人在鏡頭前展現出極大反差萌，由深情款款突變為搞笑互寸，引發現場工作人員失控大笑。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>《港出好味道》大結局盡顯成員默契</strong></b></h2>\n<p>這次遠赴英國取景拍攝工作長達大半個月，是兩位女團成員難得放下偶像包袱深度交流的機會。節目自11月2日首播以來，觀眾一直見證著她們在異國他鄉四處尋覓港式風味，早前試食特色甜品時蘇雅琳更因為吃得太飽而摸著肚子笑言：「仲有？我個Baby要出世啦！」展露真性情。兩人在鏡頭前毫無保留地展現搞怪一面。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>網民激讚兩人互動充滿極高娛樂性</strong></b></h2>\n<p>該集節目播出後迅速在各大社交平台洗版，粉絲紛紛截圖轉發這段充滿戲劇張力的搞笑片段。不少網民留言大讚兩人火花十足，有人直指「Ivy個樣真係好flirty，暈咗」、「Gao叫姐姐嗰下真係破壞王上身，笑到肚痛」、「Ivy未開蓋倒酒真係好呆好可愛」。同時也有大批觀眾對節目迎來尾聲留言表達依依不捨，並敲碗要求電視台盡快開拍第二季。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533565414147896_6564236046b02a5e6e7845.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy來到港人開設的Cafe「見字飲啡」的韓式特製芝士蜂蜜蒜茸貝果，感到好驚喜。（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533565414147896_6564236046b02a5e6e7845.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy來到港人開設的Cafe「見字飲啡」的韓式特製芝士蜂蜜蒜茸貝果，感到好驚喜。（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953356598251570_9584026996b02a5ec931c9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy大讚好食到O晒嘴，坦言未食過這口味。（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953356598251570_9584026996b02a5ec931c9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy大讚好食到O晒嘴，坦言未食過這口味。（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533566535937177_13794137416b02a5f1e3add.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy在酒吧親自調製雞尾酒，但倒極唔出？（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533566535937177_13794137416b02a5f1e3add.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy在酒吧親自調製雞尾酒，但倒極唔出？（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533567234412553_3646520686b02a5f8d6960.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Kit急忙救駕，原來Ivy心急到未開蓋！（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533567234412553_3646520686b02a5f8d6960.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kit急忙救駕，原來Ivy心急到未開蓋！（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953356784587489_14671606536b02a5ff0604c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy、Gao和Kit在酒吧做一口店長，學習水吧和出餐。（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953356784587489_14671606536b02a5ff0604c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy、Gao和Kit在酒吧做一口店長，學習水吧和出餐。（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533568597526937_7158194976b02a60674c95.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy落場招呼客人，做了多集節目，當然手到拿來！（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533568597526937_7158194976b02a60674c95.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy落場招呼客人，做了多集節目，當然手到拿來！（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533569208250911_18877131656b02a60cc3231.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ViuTV 港出好味道 Ivy、Gao、酒吧老闆及食客小朋友玩selfie。大批觀眾對節目迎來尾聲留言表達依依不捨。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179533569208250911_18877131656b02a60cc3231.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy、Gao、酒吧老闆及食客小朋友玩selfie。大批觀眾對節目迎來尾聲留言表達依依不捨。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/gao-%e6%b2%88%e8%b2%9e%e5%b7%a7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gao 沈貞巧</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ivy%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ivy 蘇雅琳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/viutv/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ViuTV</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%87%ba%e5%a5%bd%e5%91%b3%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港出好味道</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 22 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:03:48.092009+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1627,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:21:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:24.679741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:57:27.201466+00:00","content_hash":"ac73a6e32ee7d780af0cccc8b47330000ac00211646a82c424a66f733de28934","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}